{"seq":2,"slug":"high-energy-neutrinos","title":"高能中微子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/multi-messenger/high-energy-neutrinos","wordCount":1658,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"高能中微子\">高能中微子</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>高能天体物理中微子是一类近乎无质量、只参与弱相互作用的粒子，能量可达 PeV（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{15}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV）量级。正因为它几乎不与物质作用，它能从最致密的天体内核、被星际介质和宇宙背景光遮蔽的深处径直飞向地球——而<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/synchrotron-inverse-compton\">同步辐射与逆康普顿</a>等电磁辐射会被吸收，超高能<a href=\"cosmic-rays\">宇宙线</a>会被磁场偏转。这种&quot;穿透性 + 直线传播&quot;的组合，使中微子成为指向高能源最干净的信使。</p>\n<p>中微子的天体物理意义还在于它是&quot;强子加速&quot;的确凿证据。电子加速只产生电磁辐射，而质子等强子被<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/particle-acceleration\">粒子加速机制</a>加速后撞击物质或光子，会产生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 介子，进而衰变出中微子。因此探测到天体中微子，等于直接证明该源在加速强子——这是连接<a href=\"../compact-objects/black-holes-accretion\">黑洞与吸积盘</a>喷流与<a href=\"cosmic-rays\">宇宙线</a>起源的关键拼图。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[源内强子被加速] --&gt; B{靶物质}&#10;  B --&gt;|质子-质子| C[pp 碰撞产 pi 介子]&#10;  B --&gt;|质子-光子| D[p gamma 经 Delta 共振产 pi 介子]&#10;  C --&gt; E[带电 pi 衰变出中微子]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  C --&gt; F[中性 pi 衰变出伽马光子]&#10;  E --&gt; G[中微子直线穿越宇宙]&#10;  G --&gt; H[冰/水中切伦科夫探测]&#10;  H --&gt; I[反推源方向与能谱]&#10;  F --&gt; J[伽马射线多信使关联]\">flowchart TD\n  A[源内强子被加速] --&gt; B{靶物质}\n  B --&gt;|质子-质子| C[pp 碰撞产 pi 介子]\n  B --&gt;|质子-光子| D[p gamma 经 Delta 共振产 pi 介子]\n  C --&gt; E[带电 pi 衰变出中微子]\n  D --&gt; E\n  C --&gt; F[中性 pi 衰变出伽马光子]\n  E --&gt; G[中微子直线穿越宇宙]\n  G --&gt; H[冰/水中切伦科夫探测]\n  H --&gt; I[反推源方向与能谱]\n  F --&gt; J[伽马射线多信使关联]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信使</th>\n<th>是否被偏转</th>\n<th>是否被吸收</th>\n<th>能否指向源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光子</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（高能段）</td>\n<td>能，但受吸收限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带电<a href=\"cosmic-rays\">宇宙线</a></td>\n<td>是（磁场）</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>最高能段勉强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中微子</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>几乎不</td>\n<td>能，最干净</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"gravitational-waves\">引力波</a></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>定位较粗</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"产生机制与味比\">产生机制与味比</h2><p>天体中微子来自强子相互作用。被加速的高能质子有两条产生路径：与周围物质碰撞的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pp</span></span></span></span></span> 过程，以及与光子场作用、经 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 共振的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 过程。两者都产生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 介子——带电 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 衰变链 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><msub><mi>ν</mi><mi>μ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^+\\to\\mu^+\\nu_\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0574em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0637em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><msub><mi>ν</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>ν</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>μ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu^+\\to e^+\\nu_e\\bar\\nu_\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0574em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0637em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0637em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 给出中微子，中性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>→</mo><mi>γ</mi><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^0\\to\\gamma\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 则给出伽马光子。</p>\n<p>这一共同起源带来两个强有力的诊断。其一是能量对应：中微子约带走母质子能量的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/20</span></span></span></span></span>，因此 PeV 中微子指向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>16</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim10^{16}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> eV 的质子加速。其二是味比：在源处产生的味比约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>ν</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>ν</mi><mi>μ</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>ν</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\nu_e:\\nu_\\mu:\\nu_\\tau)=(1:2:0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0637em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0637em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0637em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，经过宇宙距离的中微子振荡后到达地球时被&quot;洗&quot;成约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1:1:1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。观测到接近均等的味比，本身就验证了标准的强子产生图像与长基线振荡。由于伽马光子和中微子同源，对同一源同时测两者，就能把强子成分与<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/synchrotron-inverse-compton\">同步辐射与逆康普顿</a>的轻子成分区分开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"探测原理与本底压制\">探测原理与本底压制</h2><p>中微子截面极小，必须用巨大体积的透明介质（南极冰、深海水）作靶。当中微子偶尔与介质核子作用产生带电轻子（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 子），该轻子以超光速（介质中）穿行，发出切伦科夫光锥，被埋设的光电倍增管阵列记录，由到达时间与光量反推方向和能量。</p>\n<p>最大的难题是压制本底。地球大气宇宙线产生的大气 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 子和大气中微子，数量远超天体中微子。主要策略有三：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>本底来源</th>\n<th>压制策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大气 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 子（向下）</td>\n<td>用整个地球作屏蔽，只看向上穿地事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大气中微子</td>\n<td>选最高能事件（天体谱更硬，高能端胜出）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>探测器边缘噪声</td>\n<td>用外层探测器作&quot;自否决&quot;反符合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>利用地球本身屏蔽向下的大气 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 子，是中微子望远镜放在南极冰下、地中海或贝加尔湖深处的根本原因。具体设施与布局见<a href=\"../facilities-coordination/xray-gamma-telescopes\">X 射线与伽马望远镜</a>章节末对中微子望远镜的归纳与<a href=\"../facilities-coordination/joint-alerts\">多信使联合警报</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"已确认的源与弥散通量\">已确认的源与弥散通量</h2><p>2013 年 IceCube 首次确认了一束弥散的天体中微子通量（如 PeV 级的 Bert、Ernie、Big Bird 事件），证明宇宙存在高能中微子背景，但当时无法定位具体源。突破出现在 2017 年 9 月：IceCube 探测到一个约 290 TeV 的中微子事件 IC-170922A，方向与正在伽马耀发的耀变体 TXS 0506+056 一致，关联显著性约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>，这是首次把一个高能中微子事件与一个具体的<a href=\"../compact-objects/black-holes-accretion\">黑洞与吸积盘</a>喷流源联系起来。</p>\n<p>2022 年，IceCube 报告了来自附近活动星系 NGC 1068（塞弗特星系）的稳态中微子辐射，显著性约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4.2</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4.2\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>，成为迄今最可靠的稳态天体中微子源。耐人寻味的是，NGC 1068 的高能伽马辐射被自身致密环境吸收，中微子却得以逃逸——这正凸显了中微子作为&quot;穿透型信使&quot;看见伽马看不见之处的独特价值。这些发现共同表明，天体中微子背景很可能由<a href=\"../compact-objects/black-holes-accretion\">黑洞与吸积盘</a>核区与喷流贡献，而这类源也是超高能<a href=\"cosmic-rays\">宇宙线</a>的候选加速器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"宇宙背景中微子与未来设施\">宇宙背景中微子与未来设施</h2><p>除了来自具体源的中微子，理论还预言一类弥散的&quot;宇宙背景&quot;（cosmogenic）中微子：超高能<a href=\"cosmic-rays\">宇宙线</a>质子在传播途中与宇宙微波背景发生 GZK 反应，副产的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 介子衰变出 EeV 量级中微子。探测到它，将间接确认超高能宇宙线确实是质子、且 GZK 机制确实在起作用，是连接两类信使的&quot;圣杯&quot;之一，但其极低通量要求比现有探测器大得多的有效体积。</p>\n<p>这正是下一代设施的驱动力。下表归纳全球中微子望远镜的格局：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设施</th>\n<th>介质</th>\n<th>状态（2026）</th>\n<th>主攻能段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IceCube</td>\n<td>南极冰</td>\n<td>运行中</td>\n<td>TeV–PeV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IceCube-Gen2</td>\n<td>南极冰</td>\n<td>规划/建设</td>\n<td>提升约一个量级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KM3NeT</td>\n<td>地中海水</td>\n<td>分阶段部署</td>\n<td>GeV–PeV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Baikal-GVD</td>\n<td>贝加尔湖水</td>\n<td>扩建中</td>\n<td>TeV–PeV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>射电阵列（如 RNO-G）</td>\n<td>南极冰</td>\n<td>试验</td>\n<td>EeV（cosmogenic）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>IceCube-Gen2 计划把仪器化体积扩大约一个数量级，目标是把目前仅几个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 的源探测推到确凿水平，并捕获更多像 NGC 1068 这样的<a href=\"../compact-objects/black-holes-accretion\">黑洞与吸积盘</a>核区源。把南北半球水/冰探测器联网，还能实现近全天覆盖的实时<a href=\"../facilities-coordination/joint-alerts\">多信使联合警报</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>高能中微子近乎无质量、不被偏转也几乎不被吸收，是指向高能源最干净的信使，与<a href=\"gravitational-waves\">引力波</a>、光子、<a href=\"cosmic-rays\">宇宙线</a>互补。</li>\n<li>中微子来自强子相互作用（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pp</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>），其探测直接证明源在加速强子，与<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/particle-acceleration\">粒子加速机制</a>和<a href=\"cosmic-rays\">宇宙线</a>起源紧密相关。</li>\n<li>源处味比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1:2:0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 经振荡到达地球变为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1:1:1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；伽马与中微子同源，可分离强子与轻子成分。</li>\n<li>探测靠大体积冰/水中的切伦科夫光，用地球屏蔽与高能选择压制大气本底。</li>\n<li>IceCube 已确认弥散通量、耀变体 TXS 0506+056（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>）与稳态源 NGC 1068（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4.2</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4.2\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>），把中微子源指向<a href=\"../compact-objects/black-holes-accretion\">黑洞与吸积盘</a>核区与喷流。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高能中微子","id":"高能中微子"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"产生机制与味比","id":"产生机制与味比"},{"level":2,"text":"探测原理与本底压制","id":"探测原理与本底压制"},{"level":2,"text":"已确认的源与弥散通量","id":"已确认的源与弥散通量"},{"level":2,"text":"宇宙背景中微子与未来设施","id":"宇宙背景中微子与未来设施"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"引力波探测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/multi-messenger/gravitational-waves"},"next":{"title":"宇宙线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/multi-messenger/cosmic-rays"}}